HEAD:.buildkite/k3_harness/README.md:128:This runs `gpu-monitor.sh` every 10 minutes. It distinguishes K8s pod processes (in `kubepods` cgroups) from stale host processes and logs warnings to `/var/log/gpu-monitor.log` with PID, command, GPU, memory usage, and process age.
